 "section_summary": "This section contains educational survey reports compiled by the Analysis and Research Division of the Civil Information and Education Section under GHQ, SCAP. Pages 173 to 231 comprise the concluding portion of the statistical roster of educational institutions in Ehime Prefecture, documenting town and village elementary schools, private colleges and secondary schools, institutions under other government ministries, and a concluding map of Shikoku. Pages 232 to 236 contain the preliminary front matter—including title page, report metadata, table of contents, and introduction—for the corresponding report on educational institutions in Tottori Prefecture.",
