   "summary": "This concluding section of the Ehime Prefecture roster details municipal and village elementary schools, kindergartens, private vocational and middle schools, girls' high schools, youth schools, and institutions administered by ministries other than the Ministry of Education. It includes enrollment and faculty counts by gender as of April 30 and November 30, 1946, and concludes with a reference map of Shikoku.",
